Matthew	Mt	47	16	1	And there came to him the Pharisees and Sadducees tempting: and they asked him to shew them a sign from heaven.
Matthew	Mt	47	16	2	But he answered and said to them: When it is evening, you say, It will be fair weather, for the sky is red.
