Matthew	Mt	47	21	1	And when they drew nigh to Jerusalem, and were come to Bethphage, unto mount Olivet, then Jesus sent two disciples,
Matthew	Mt	47	21	2	Saying to them: Go ye into the village that is over against you, and immediately you shall find an ass tied, and a colt with her: loose them and bring them to me.
Matthew	Mt	47	21	3	And if any man shall say anything to you, say ye, that the Lord hath need of them: and forthwith he will let them go.
