Matthew	Mt	47	21	9	And the multitudes that went before and that followed, cried, saying: Hosanna to the son of David: Blessed is he that cometh in the name of the Lord: Hosanna in the highest.
Matthew	Mt	47	21	10	And when he was come into Jerusalem, the whole city was moved, saying: Who is this?
Matthew	Mt	47	21	11	And the people said: This is Jesus the prophet, from Nazareth of Galilee.
