Mark	Mk	48	11	26	But if you will not forgive, neither will your Father that is in heaven, forgive you your sins.
Mark	Mk	48	11	27	And they come again to Jerusalem. And when he was walking in the temple, there come to him the chief priests and the scribes and the ancients,
Mark	Mk	48	11	28	And they say to him: By what authority dost thou these things? and who hath given thee this authority that thou shouldst do these things?
Mark	Mk	48	11	29	And Jesus answering, said to them: I will also ask you one word, and answer you me, and I will tell you by what authority I do these things.
