Mark	Mk	48	13	35	Watch ye therefore, (for you know not when the lord of the house cometh: at even, or at midnight, or at the cockcrowing, or in the morning,)
Mark	Mk	48	13	36	Lest coming on a sudden, he find you sleeping.
Mark	Mk	48	13	37	And what I say to you, I say to all: Watch.
Mark	Mk	48	14	1	Now the feast of the pasch, and of the Azymes was after two days; and the chief priests and the scribes sought how they might by some wile lay hold on him, and kill him.
