Mark	Mk	48	15	1	And straightway in the morning, the chief priests holding a consultation with the ancients and the scribes and the whole council, binding Jesus, led him away, and delivered him to Pilate.
Mark	Mk	48	15	2	And Pilate asked him: Art thou the king of the Jews? But he answering, saith to him: Thou sayest it.
