Mark	Mk	48	15	22	And they bring him into the place called Golgotha, which being interpreted is, The place of Calvary.
Mark	Mk	48	15	23	And they gave him to drink wine mingled with myrrh; but he took it not.
Mark	Mk	48	15	24	And crucifying him, they divided his garments, casting lots upon them, what every man should take.
Mark	Mk	48	15	25	And it was the third hour, and they crucified him.
Mark	Mk	48	15	26	And the inscription of his cause was written over: THE KING OF THE JEWS.
